<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Vogel (1979) & Douady–Couder (1992) Golden-Angle Phyllotaxis — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-18"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Vogel's (1979) planar spiral law, rising Fibonacci parastichy cascade (8,13)->(13,21)->(21,34)->(34,55), Lucas (29,47)->(47,76) branch, and bijugate 2*(21,34) = (42,68) whorls are reproduced and verified by Delaunay contact-graph topology. Douady & Couder's (1992) Hofmeister repulsive energy minimization converges from disparate initial angles (175 deg and 130 deg -> 137.59 deg; 99.8 deg -> 99.38 deg), and the noisy rim-dislocation ensemble mechanistically links outer-rim contact chain loss to Swinton et al.'s (2016) Fib-1 > Fib+1 grain-defect bias." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Vogel (1979) & Douady–Couder (1992) Golden-Angle Phyllotaxis — Morphometric validation: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-18"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Bounded Voronoi polygon clipping with 72 outer guard vertices completely resolves the v1 unbounded-cell artifact: `rational_120.0` now scores `voronoi_cv_area = 0.6207` and `mean_circularity = 0.0284`, while the golden angle (`137.5078 deg`) simultaneously minimizes `voronoi_cv_area` (`0.007209`), minimizes `nnd_cv` (`0.011108`), and maximizes Voronoi circularity (`0.852513`). All 7 morphometrics are independently verified in `2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit-v2.measurements.yaml`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-measurement-douady-couder-1992-hofmeister-lucas-branch-emergent-divergence-angle>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-measurement-douady-couder-1992-hofmeister-main-branch-emergent-divergence-angle>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-measurement-empirical-specimen-photograph-segmented-floret-voronoi-circularity-4-a-p>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-measurement-golden-divergence-angle-360>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-measurement-mechanistic-rim-dislocation-ensemble-pearson-r-vs-swinton-2016-table-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-measurement-outer-annulus-14-5-22-5-opposed-contact-parastichy-ratio-n-m>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-measurement-swinton-et-al-2016-photoreviewed-fibonacci-structure-prevalence>,
