    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-vogel-phyllotaxis-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Vogel (1979) & Douady–Couder (1992) Golden-Angle Phyllotaxis — MorphoEval overall 85.9/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-18"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Remediated v2 reproduction of Vogel (1979) and Douady & Couder (1992, 1996) golden-angle phyllotaxis validated against Swinton et al. (2016) Royal Society Helianthus annuus parastichy data and direct Difference-of-Gaussians floret segmentation on a real capitulum photograph (621 segmented florets, 402 interior Voronoi cells, mean circularity 0.793 vs 0.853 model). All four defects surfaced in the v1 dual-agent audit are resolved and verified by automated assertions in `run_self_tests()`. Overall 85.9/100 (faithfulness 84.7, reproducibility 88.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit c89d18d; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 86, Morphological realism / specimen match 84, Parameter expressivity 82, Morphometric validation 86, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 88, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: vogel_phyllotaxis_comparison.png: rendered output of 1979-vogel-phyllotaxis.py at c89d18d, image/png, 2217939 B, 2960×1840 px, artifact_sha256 3ab57a6be31aab64ec4cfa6db34f77b8f19cb2744a812f3fba01a6c8f26f1c3c (sha256 3ab57a6be31aab64ec4cfa6db34f77b8f19cb2744a812f3fba01a6c8f26f1c3c), spec_fingerprint 5df8c2b4cc4b9b4a86ea26aace00ebd26df8456a62d99c23287ddcea2644e06c. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 5df8c2b4cc4b9b4a86ea26aace00ebd26df8456a62d99c23287ddcea2644e06c; artifact_sha256: 3ab57a6be31aab64ec4cfa6db34f77b8f19cb2744a812f3fba01a6c8f26f1c3c; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/phyllotaxis/helianthus_annuus_capitulum_specimen.jpg=c76483eea3e564fe..., datasets/phyllotaxis/helianthus_parastichy_annotated.jpg=7cd34354e23584cb..., datasets/phyllotaxis/phyllotaxis_reference.json=432d1eeebf62bdc7...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-18-phyllotaxis-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Vogel (1979) defines planar capitulum spiral placement r_n = c*sqrt(n), theta_n = n*alpha_0 with golden divergence angle alpha_0 = 360/tau^2 = 137.507764 deg | Douady & Couder (1992, 1996) demonstrate self-organized convergence of repulsive Hofmeister primordia on a radially advecting meristem ring to the golden and Lucas noble angles | Swinton, Ochu & MSI Turing's Sunflower Consortium (2016) report 768 photoreviewed parastichy counts across 657 Helianthus annuus heads (82.3% Fibonacci structure; 49 Fib-1 vs 17 Fib+1, binomial p = 5.07e-5); reconstructed_in_script: Planar Vogel spiral generator, Delaunay/Voronoi rising Fibonacci parastichy cascade (8,13)->(13,21)->(21,34)->(34,55), bounded Voronoi area CV & circularity optimality, Douady-Couder Hofmeister relaxation, DoG floret segmentation on helianthus_annuus_capitulum_specimen.jpg, and rim-dislocation ensemble reproducing Fib-1 > Fib+1; transfer_boundary: Outer-rim Delaunay contact-chain loss on noisy capitula used to model the empirical excess of Fibonacci-1 over Fibonacci+1 counts in Swinton et al. (2016); does_not_claim: Full 3D auxin PIN1 transport PDE simulation on a curved dome (uses Vogel's kinematic spiral and Douady & Couder's effective Hofmeister inhibitory potential)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the Douady–Couder Hofmeister potential directly to a continuum auxin-PIN1 reaction-advection-diffusion solver on the meristematic dome (Jönsson et al. 2006 / Newell et al. 2008).",
        "remediation needed: Extend specimen image analysis from 2D planar projection to 3D dome surface profilometry when micro-CT capitulum scans become available." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.59e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

